# The account greetd runs the greeter as. No shell and no password: it exists to own a
# session before anybody has logged in.
#
# `video` is the only group it needs. The compositor opens DRM and input through libseat,
# which goes by way of logind where there is one and only falls back to seatd otherwise, so
# neither `seat` nor `login` membership is required -- verified on the KVM, and cosmic-greeter
# on Arch is set up the same way (`cosmic-greeter : cosmic-greeter video`).

#Type Name          ID GECOS                   Home directory          Shell
u     wlrix-greeter -  "wlRIX Greeter Account" /var/lib/wlrix-greeter  -
m     wlrix-greeter video
